### UMKM-in Backend API Testing File
### Gunakan ekstensi "REST Client" atau "Thunder Client" di VS Code untuk mengeksekusi request ini langsung.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. Register Akun Baru
# Setelah request ini dijalankan, cek terminal backend untuk melihat kode [DEV OTP]
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ayu Lestari",
  "email": "ayu.lestari@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordRahasia123!"
}

### 3. Verifikasi OTP Email
# Masukkan kode OTP 6 digit yang tercetak di terminal backend
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ayu.lestari@example.com",
  "otp_code": "123456"
}

### 4. Kirim Ulang Kode OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ayu.lestari@example.com"
}

### 5. Login Akun Manual
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email_or_username": "ayu.lestari@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordRahasia123!"
}

### 6. Ambil Profil Saya (Protected - Wajib Sertakan Token JWT)
# Salin token dari respon login/verify-otp ke header Authorization di bawah:
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Perbarui Profil / Onboarding (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ayu_dapur",
  "full_name": "Ayu Lestari - Dapur Bunda",
  "phone_number": "6281234567890",
  "bio": "Menjual aneka camilan dan kue rumahan khas Bandung.",
  "city": "Bandung, Jawa Barat",
  "address_detail": "Jl. Cihampelas No. 12, Bandung",
  "latitude": -6.899201,
  "longitude": 107.604212,
  "avatar_url": "https://storage.umkm-in.id/avatars/ayu.jpg"
}
